    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 3040,
        "height": 250,
        "content": "## Human approval boundary — connected release path\nThis workflow follows the reference course's Gmail **Send and Wait** pattern. Approval is bound to the displayed SHA-256 payload hash; rejection makes no MailerLite call, and a changed payload is blocked before draft creation. Replace the reviewer, sender, group, schedule and credentials with training values. Direct HTML content creation requires a MailerLite plan that supports the campaign content field."
      },
